## CI/CD

- `ci.yml` runs the same gates per component, then the facts job against the Docker stack, and uploads the evidence.
- `cd.yml` (push to `<%defaultBranch%>` / tags) calls CI first, builds each image **once** (tag `sha-<12 chars>`), pushes to `ghcr.io/<%ownerLower%>/`, then deploys:
<%#environments%>
  - `<%name%>` (<%trigger%>) -> <%url%>
<%/environments%>
- Add required reviewers to a GitHub Environment (Settings -> Environments) to gate promotion. Deploy target: `<%cdTarget%>` (`scripts/deploy.sh`, `deploy/targets/`). Roll back by re-deploying an earlier `sha-` tag.
- After every deploy the live URL is checked with the same facts (`--no-runtime --base-url ...`).

<%/hasCd%>
